With his left hand he held her, having eyes like to lotus-petals, by the hair, and with his right hand got hold of her thighs.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.871,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-49-13"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3047016","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"31767ee1f9bbee8e15cf710b881c7a41aac5855d889a62a574119eb550491b5d","compact":"dbccb27fd18259c272bc264022d669bf51f46ea1c9b542da3976c9dac3791274","nasal":"dbccb27fd18259c272bc264022d669bf51f46ea1c9b542da3976c9dac3791274"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-47-17","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":47,"verse":17,"english":"Seeing Rāvaņa of sharpened teeth, and mighty arms, resembling the summit of a mountain and like to death itself, the deities of the forest became highly terrified and fled in different directions.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.893,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-49-14"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3047017","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"a0097c98a8680bfdf793b35a2ebd6c88fddeb424d3cbd46e0dddaf9a57abb9c2","compact":"b2ad793a7b3625a5b851770548fab13ba949b906ec0e5dcd3abc563ab104a06e","nasal":"bb67a778a7590e3e9fbb1005cb508ea491008edfbbb60f6f5b6e5d2d11445912"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-47-18","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":47,"verse":18,"english":"Instantly appeared there the celestial car of Ravana, decked in gold, drawn by asses and making a terrible sound.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-49-15"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3047018","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"cc48ed1dd413770ba410e7ce026faf89dde8d06582accf4c1791ceac4e3225dd","compact":"bb1336a33e944e0f2fac4e392a47d933807cee82e10a4091c64acda819325d8d","nasal":"db